Package: statci
Title: Automated Statistical CI/CD, Calibration Fuzzing, and Manuscript Auditing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcus", "Harris", , "marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides automated continuous integration and verification tools for
    statistical R pipelines and manuscripts. Includes an abstract syntax tree
    (AST) statistical linter for R scripts and 'Quarto'/'RMarkdown' documents,
    an estimator calibration and simulation-based calibration (SBC) fuzzing
    harness with Monte Carlo error bounds, parallel RNG invariance testing, a
    manuscript-to-model numerical consistency auditor, an adversarial
    sensitivity battery, standalone HTML and Markdown audit reports, and a
    'GitHub Actions' workflow generator.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MarcusHarrisUConn/statci
BugReports: https://github.com/MarcusHarrisUConn/statci/issues
